Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:44.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:54.52,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:03.16,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:09.52,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.88,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:18.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:23.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:29.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:32.88,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:38.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:41.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:45.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:52.48,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:57.12,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:01.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:06.00,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:15.16,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,All this guy has done is scheme
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,to lure me into this trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's way too vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just here for the 18 Plum Blossoms Restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,but this mountain's restrictions are strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he makes a move,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,the outcome isn't certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:30.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the very beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,you've been scheming against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I right or not ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish to borrow that spell of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,that can freeze everything !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Stop Spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:03:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,For my whole life,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've always disliked those that scheme against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,as long as you are willing to help me with the Stop Spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the slave imprint that bound my Li Family for tens of thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,can be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:26.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The affairs of your Li Family
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,have nothing to do with me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Annihilation Restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is the Annihilation Restriction ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It really resonates with this mountain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,you still have some family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This restriction is connected to the entire mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:03.39,Third,,0,0,0,,If you dare to touch me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:05.72,Third,,0,0,0,,they won't survive either !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has the aura of the second step.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it was only for the 18 Plum Blossoms Restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't be worth the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You talk too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once we reach the summit,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:17.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will kill you and offer your blood as sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have let you see
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,this dirty business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have never meant you any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:32.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just hoped you would use your spell to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have already withdrawn the restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,so please hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Li Family
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,was renowned in ancient times for its restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,our Ancestor was branded with a Celestial slave imprint here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and since then our family has withered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Generation after generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter how brilliant our talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivating up to Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:05:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,was the maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our lifespan is barely 30% of those at the same level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bloodline
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,is slowly fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,To sever the imprint
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,countless members of my Li Family willingly offered themselves as sacrifices
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Their flesh, blood, and souls
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,were used to forge this sword that can break the imprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,because of the Ge Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the whole plan fell apart !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the Li Family
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,has only me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,my younger sister, and my elderly mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough lifespan to wait for the next opening of the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:40.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I fail this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Li bloodline
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:44.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,will truly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Risking everything to protect his family
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't seem like a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:06:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You deceived me first,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,how can I trust you now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,"To be a gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,honesty is key
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,while deception is a disgrace."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the motto of the Li Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I really can't take that gamble...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Brother Xu can use his Stop Spell to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm 90% sure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can break the imprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this jade slip,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will find the first 13 restrictions of the 18 Plum Blossoms Restriction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I offer them to you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,as an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,and as a sign of sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It really is the 18 Plum Blossoms Restriction...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I came for this restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:47.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,never expecting to obtain it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although he's a schemer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,his heart is genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:55.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,All you need is the Stop Spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:07:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The source of the imprint
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,is inside the Celestial statue at the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by shattering the statue with this sword
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,can the imprint be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you willing to help me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last 5 of the 18 Plum Blossoms Restriction must never be passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But once this matter is settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am willing to break ancestral rule
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and give you the remaining 5 as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,you used your Peak Ascendant cultivation to stir the entire mountain's energy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:09:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,while having the aura of the second step.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:01.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand at first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but now I see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,that your restrictions share the same origin as this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,That being the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,it makes sense for you to control it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu is very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,was created by the Annihilation Restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,one of the four great ancient restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,that embodies the essence of illusory and corporeal...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it's been long lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only my Li Family has some of its inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:35.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,has transcended the grades of Heaven, Earth, Mysterious, and Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Precisely,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,people think there are only 4 grades of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:41.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,that there is a level above
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,called the Void grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:47.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Void grade is divided into 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,they are the 4 great ancient restrictions that stand above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,After grasping their true essence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,all restrictions become like an extension of your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:09:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter where, no matter the size,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:00.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,they all follow my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it really the end ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Yuan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Li !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your mission
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:33.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(251,482)}Li Yuan's\NSea of Consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sea of Consciousness ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:37.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who I am ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The imprint on your Li Family
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:51.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,was my doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you enter my Sea of Consciousness ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have always been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the moment the imprint was planted,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have been within your bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever someone breaks through to Ascendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:24.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(287,451)}Celestial Slave Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since the imprint was placed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:32.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,among my family's generations, the only Ascendants
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,are Ancestor Li Jinglan and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:38.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Jinglan died without ever knowing I had possessed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,are somewhat stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was you !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1695,409)}10 000 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:59.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(284,528)\fad(300,300)}Li Jinglan\NLi Family Ancestor\NEarly stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:11:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,with this sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will sever the curse that has plagued my family for generations !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:27.52,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1660,507)}Ge Yunfeng\NGe Family Ancestor\NEarly stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ge Yunfeng pays respects to Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is the sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,ready ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:35.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pure-blooded direct descendant is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,We of the Ge Family are descendants of the Celestial Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Lord's revival
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,is our duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,is ready !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Li Family's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,was forged to sever the imprint !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sever the imprint ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the moment your Li Ancestor brought back that imprint,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,he was already my puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,That sword
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:09.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,was refined from the very beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to nourish a Celestial Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,You,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Jinglan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and all of the Li Family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,are my pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:23.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every step you took
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:26.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,was a path I paved for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was all to bring me back to this place
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and fulfill my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:38.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was only one step short back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,with that Xu Mu here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not fail again !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,So from the very beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was all a lie ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,, I have cultivated all my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't dare to slack off for a single day...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,What was even the point
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,of everything
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I ever did ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Li !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've dragged you into this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I fear that I, Li Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,will never get a chance to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Li...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:34.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,just the imprint's backlash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's go to the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,it seemed like he had two auras.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:14:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But nothing is unusual...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was it an illusion ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:06.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,something is not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earlier I felt on Li Yuan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,a familiar feeling that made my scalp tingle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:33.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,the fall of the Thunder Celestial Realm !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,My sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:45.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,appear !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:47.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(255,465)\fad(300,300)}Gu Ziyuan\NCelestial General
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:49.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can the might of a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,be this strong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lost
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,but my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:50.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,was calling him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:10.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,this day has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,with your blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will settle my family's grievance !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:29.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This statue is filled with overwhelming sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,far beyond what an obsession would create.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,help me quickly !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I happened to see an illusion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the ancient Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:41.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,where this Celestial held a sword and slew enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That sword's power was astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why is the hand of this statue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:49.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,empty ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:52.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,A sword is born to protect its master,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,it shouldn't outlive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:54.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since its master is no more,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,has long since been broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:18:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Brother Xu finds the reward insufficient,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:02.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can give you more !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last 5 of the 18 Plum Blossoms Restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.48,0:19:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,along with the true inheritance of the Annihilation Restriction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,After this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,they will both be yours !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have sensed it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside of the statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh my...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sword is on the brink of shattering
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,but somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:34.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's still holding on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Mu !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You already agreed to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,why are you going back on your word ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I agreed to help Li Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,not you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Sword Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,is my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A low-grade Celestial Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,dares to act recklessly before me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you help me revive the Celestial Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you may live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:35.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.20,0:20:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,An illusion restriction ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Yuan's invitation earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:54.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,was probably also part of his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If his goal is to revive the Celestial Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,then what am I here for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you stubbornly refuse to yield,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,then let me show you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,what the true
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,18 Plum Blossoms Restriction really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:16.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,First restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Plum blossoms' first bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:22.32,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(275,472)\fad(300,300)}First restriction\N18 Plum Blossoms Restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:36.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fourth restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:38.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(275,484)}Fourth restriction\N18 Plum Blossoms Restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:38.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Broken branches cast shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:43.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,These shadows, born from the restriction, regenerate endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also, all the restrictions in this place are under his control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:47.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't fight him head-on !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The restriction is becoming unstable ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.24,0:22:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's Li Yuan !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:17.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Both inside and outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the restriction is tied to Li Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.20,0:22:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by awakening Li Yuan
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:22.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,and attacking from both sides
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,do we have a way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:39.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,To revive my master,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.96,0:22:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have schemed for tens of thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Dao Heart is unwavering !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,can't break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao Heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.56,0:23:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sword Spirit !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You say your Dao Heart is unwavering
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,then why did you fail when you last came here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 000 years ago ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,why Li Yuan only asked me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,to use the Stop Spell to immobilize the statue
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.24,0:23:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to break the imprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You wish to revive the Celestial Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you still lured me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you really seek ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you wanted to borrow was never the Stop Spell
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,but this Karma Whip !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.48,0:23:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I right !?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want to use it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,to forcibly reverse the outcome of your master's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sole reason you failed 10 000 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,was not because you were stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:24:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,but because your master,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,the great Celestial General,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,is unwilling to be awakened.
Dialogue: 100,0:24:30.26,0:27:04.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0000)}The 4 ranks of restrictions (Heaven, Earth, Mysterious, Underworld) were never mentioned before so it doesn't make sense for Wang Lin to know about them. The text explaining them and the Void grade was initially a monologue by Li Yuan.\N\NThe sadness of the celestial statue is because the blood of its descendants is being sacrificed before it.\N\NIn the donghua, they attributed the celestial slave imprint to the Sword Spirit, and not just a random celestial servant's soul. That way, Xu Liguo is able to help Wang Lin to uncover the scheme. In the novel, Wang Lin figures it all out by himself.\N\N“Not only are you not Li Yuan, even the Li ancestor from tens of thousands of years ago that collected the three treasures was not himself. It was you who merged together with the slave imprint and reincarnated into the Li family!”\N“[...]you are driven by a sense of self-righteousness, believing that you must revive your master even at the expense of the entire Ge family!”\N“You can cheat others, but you can’t cheat me. As long as it is related to the reincarnation cycle, there is nothing I can’t see through!”\N“Even the flesh you’re in rejects you! Because your soul is not of the Li family!”\N“What you’re interested in isn’t my Stop spell, but… this!” In Wang Lin’s right hand, the Karma Whip flickered in and out of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.04,0:24:56.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
